OL,3,GNEWSAResidents still in hotels a week
OL,4,Aafter tower fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a week after a fire in an
OL,7,Feast London tower block, residents who
OL,8,Fhad to leave their flats still have no
OL,9,Fidea when they will be able to go home.
OL,11,FOne man died and more than 50 others
OL,12,Fwere made temporarily homeless after
OL,13,Fflames ripped through part of the 17th
OL,14,Fand 18th floors of Neutron Tower,
OL,15,FPoplar, on 12 September.
OL,17,FThose who have had to move out are
OL,18,Fstaying in hotels - with no cooking or
OL,19,Flaundry facilities - while
OL,20,Finvestigations, safety assessments and
OL,21,Frepairs are carried out.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
