OL,3,GNEWSAResidents still in hotels a week
OL,4,Aafter tower fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Port, which manages floors nine
OL,7,Fand above, said it understood how
OL,8,F"difficult and unsettling" this period
OL,9,Fof uncertainty was but it has to ensure
OL,10,Fthe building is safe before allowing
OL,11,Fpeople back in.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
